<title>JAPAN: Sanshin - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sanshin - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.68		vs	    6.10</p>
<p> Operating	  243    million	  vs	  179    million</p>
<p> Current	    267    million	  vs	  208    million</p>
<p> Net		  121    million	  vs	   88    million</p>
<p> EPS		   12.14 yen	  vs	    8.83 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sanshin Corp is a civil engineering company specialising in foundation work.</p>
